# ConnectMe is a Turborepo monorepo; each app has its own environment file.
# Copy the matching example and fill in the values. Never commit real secrets.
#
#   apps/api/.env.example     -> apps/api/.env.local     (NestJS API)
#   apps/worker/.env.example  -> apps/worker/.env.local  (BullMQ worker)
#   apps/web/.env.example     -> apps/web/.env.local     (Next.js web)
#
# Quick reference of what each app needs:
#
#   api     NODE_ENV, API_PORT, DATABASE_URL, REDIS_URL/REDIS_HOST/REDIS_PORT,
#           ENCRYPTION_KEY, NEXT_PUBLIC_META_GRAPH_VERSION,
#           META_APP_ID/META_APP_SECRET/META_CLIENT_ID/META_CLIENT_SECRET,
#           META_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN, NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL, S3_*
#
#   worker  NODE_ENV, DATABASE_URL, REDIS_URL/REDIS_HOST/REDIS_PORT,
#           ENCRYPTION_KEY (same as api), NEXT_PUBLIC_META_GRAPH_VERSION
#
#   web     NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL, API_URL, NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL,
#           NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, CLERK_SECRET_KEY,
#           NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_IN_URL, NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_*_FALLBACK_REDIRECT_URL,
#           CONTACT_EMAIL
#
# ENCRYPTION_KEY must be identical in api and worker (it decrypts the same
# tenant provider tokens). Generate it with: openssl rand -hex 32
